        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# The TPUSA Rats Are Cornered. Trapped. Desperate. Now What?\n\nA 1-hour, 44-minute Lionel Nation commentary published July 20, 2026. The publication frames Turning Point USA as facing declining audience trust, internal tensions, leadership questions, and intensifying scrutiny after Charlie Kirk’s death.\n\nThis is a concept-level first pass based on the publisher’s metadata and description because the exposed automatic-caption track returned no transcript. Claims and characterizations remain attributed to Lionel and the publication."
      }
    },
